  "prefLabel": "He-C 5010.04 Staff Support",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 5010.04 Staff Support. The department shall name one staff person to consult with the DUR board and participate in the DUR board’s deliberations. This individual shall not be a voting member of the DUR board and shall not be assigned to any drug-related SURS function within the department.\n\nSource. #5529, eff 12-16-92; ss by #5608, eff 4-6-93; ss by #6907, eff 12-9-98; ss by #8743, eff 10-24-06; ss by #9587, eff 11-4-09 (from He-C 5010.05); ss by #12460, eff 1-13-18",
